# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# V-Base — repository root environment index
#
# V-Base keeps environment configuration next to the component that owns it, so
# there is no single shared .env file. Copy the template that matches what you
# are running and never commit the result.
#
#   1. Backend API (FastAPI + PostgreSQL)
#        copy backend\.env.example backend\.env
#      Read by pydantic-settings from backend/.env, or from ./.env when the
#      process is launched from the repository root.
#
#   2. Frontend (Vite + React)
#        copy apps\web\.env.example apps\web\.env
#      Only VITE_-prefixed values are exposed to the browser. Never place a
#      secret here.
#
# Required for any real deployment
#   DATABASE_URL   PostgreSQL DSN, postgresql+asyncpg://... (no SQLite fallback)
#   SECRET_KEY     random 32+ character session key
#   FRONTEND_URL   exact browser origin allowed to call the API
#   VITE_API_BASE  API origin the SPA should call (when not same-origin)
#
# Files that must never be committed
#   backend/.env, apps/web/.env, .env
#   backups/*.json, backups/*.sql, backups/*.db   (contain business data)
#   uploads/*                                     (contain imported data)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
